## Executive Summary

Successfully implemented the authentication and authorization foundation for the CyberRX Multi-Agent AI Platform. All Phase 0 authentication requirements have been met, including standalone credential authentication (username/password + MFA), JWT token management, RBAC for 6 executive roles, agent-to-data authorization, and comprehensive audit logging.

